            <li>Rekeying, not full replacement, is usually all a new Smyrna home needs. Ask for a firm quote before work starts to avoid a documented national locksmith pricing scam pattern.</li>
          </ul>
        </blockquote>

        <nav aria-label="Table of contents" class="bg-[#F8F8F5] border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 mb-10 not-prose">
